  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crop2X - uses artificial intelligence and agricultural knowledge to develop data-driven insights to create high-yield agriculture farms. Crop2X&#x2019;s platform provides information to optimize day-to-day farm operations, such as optimum quantity of fertilizers, early detection of anomalies or pest predictions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will address agricultural inefficiencies through the deployment of soil probes and a GIS-based crop monitoring platform. The solution will&#xa0;empower vulnerable farming communities&#xa0;with real-time&#xa0;information, which will enable them to&#xa0;save up to 50%&#xa0;of their water resources, increase their&#xa0;crop yields by 30%, and save 30% of their inputs, leading to improved resource allocation,&#xa0;higher income, and enhanced food security.</narrative>
  </description>
